sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Manager UI
    participant API as FastAPI Routes
    participant R as Redis DB0 Phase
    participant J as Job BG or Celery
    participant PG as Postgres

    U->>API: POST /portfolios with CSV JSON PDF mandate mode
    API->>PG: Insert run created plus documents commit
    API->>R: Set phase to queued
    API-->>U: 202 Accepted with run id fast
    API->>J: Schedule background run
    J->>PG: Update status to processing commit
    J->>J: Ingest then price then allocate then drift trades
    J->>J: Cashflow then risk limits
    J->>J: News scan plus country LangGraph fail soft
    J->>J: Alerts plus score plus briefings
    J->>PG: Insert holdings alerts trades briefing plus update awaiting review
    J->>R: Set phase to done
    U->>API: GET /status poll every few seconds
    API->>R: Get phase or Postgres on terminal
    U->>API: GET /portfolios full result
    U->>API: POST question review rerun plus GET audit
